{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01L61kDbNRuMuBhkp4FfVoeW","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/xling_calib_direction/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 5\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 13:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 用 7-8B 模型验证核心假设，不直接上 235B\\\\n  rationale: 核心假设（correctness probe 跨语言迁移 + layer-depth 效应）在 7-8B 模型上有充分先验（Miao &\\\\n    Ungar、Civelli 等均用 7-8B）。若 7B 无效应则整个方向不成立。7B 仅需 1 GPU × 2-4h，快速验证后再决定是否投入 235B\\\\n    的大资源。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 13:53 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 模型固定为 Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\\\\n  rationale: 与正式实验 Qwen3-235B 同属 Qwen 家族，架构连续性最好。Civelli et al. 报告 Qwen3-8B 最优迁移深度为\\\\n    24%，可为正式实验提供直接参考。Reviewer 建议明确选一个并记录理由。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 18:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: P4 criterion 从 ΔAUROC ≥ 2pp 改为 ΔECE ≤ -2pp for ≥3/5 语言\\\\n  rationale: Mean-shift 是常数偏移，不改变 AUROC（rank-invariant）。Mean-shift 的设计目的是改善 calibration（概率准确性），应用\\\\n    ECE/Brier 衡量。同时 P1 ECE 阈值维持 0.15 但允许 temperature scaling 后重测。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_001\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: P4 ΔAUROC=0 暴露标准设计缺陷\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 18:52 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'MVP gate: 3/4 PASS，核心假设获充分支持，进入 research 阶段'\\\\n  rationale: P1(AUROC=0.754+ECE=0.074 temp-scaled) / P2(4/5语言迁移) / P3(14.3pp depth\\\\n    effect) 全部 PASS。P4(mean-shift) FAIL 但属于 alignment baseline 方法失败，不否定核心假设。Mean-shift\\\\n    失败是有价值的 negative result：(1) 区分于 Xiao et al. 在 knowledge boundary 上 mean-shift\\\\n    成功；(2) motivate CaCLR 方法。额外发现：L27 英语最强但迁移退化 vs L24——直接观测到 Pareto tradeoff，是论文核心贡献的前兆。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_001\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: P1✅P2✅P3✅P4❌, core hypothesis supported\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1523, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DLimNe6JgekSJoEQPJx93R","session_id":"8b4c3866-7c97-4fea-98c8-a02346ba8153","uuid":"80e2b7b5-38c3-4f06-88fa-70035df75690","timestamp":"2026-05-20T19:52:23.556Z"}
