{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01P4FbfNfwXWfYRE6CAn4HnA","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/xling_calib_direction/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# xling_calib_direction — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-20 19:00 UTC | 更新原因: Reviewer 修正 mean-shift 叙事 + 标注覆盖度风险 + temp scaling 待确认\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n通过中间层 correctness direction 将英语校准迁移到非英语语言。发现 depth-transferability Pareto frontier，提出 CaCLR 方法联合优化 correctness + 跨语言一致性。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- 阶段：**Research**（MVP 已通过，D004）\\\\n- 服务器：westd-13176（4× RTX 6000 PRO 96GB）\\\\n- MVP 结论：核心假设获强支持（EN AUROC=0.754, 4/5 语言迁移成功, layer-depth 14.3pp, Pareto tradeoff 直接观测）\\\\n- Mean-shift 不可靠/不一致（部分语言微改善、部分恶化，无系统性）→ motivate CaCLR\\\\n- paper_framing.md ✅ | experiment_plan.yaml ✅ | Dream 模拟进行中（dream_20260520T185641）\\\\n- ⚠️ P1 ECE pass 依赖 post-hoc temp scaling (T=6.21)，需确认是否在 held-out set 上调\\\\n\\\\n## 实验计划（详见 experiment_plan.yaml）\\\\n- **P0**：plan_001(Qwen3-235B) + plan_002(Llama4 Scout) + plan_003(CaCLR) + plan_004(difficulty ablation)\\\\n- **P1**：plan_005(orthogonality) + plan_006(probe complexity) + plan_007(Belebele/MMLU-ProX) + plan_010(INT8 ablation)\\\\n- **P2**：plan_008(Gemma4) + plan_009(50+ languages)\\\\n- **MVP**：mvp_001 ✅ | mvp_002 bug 修复中 | mvp_003 RUNNING (Llama-3.1-8B, cuda:2)\\\\n- **覆盖风险**：Claims 2/3/4 各仅 1 个实验，需 Dream 反馈后评估是否加备份\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 等待 Dream 回调，按结果调整 framing/plan\\\\n- [ ] Agent 修复 --layers 默认值 bug（M004）+ mvp_002 重跑\\\\n- [ ] Agent 确认 temp scaling 是否在 held-out set 上调\\\\n- [ ] 确认 IRT difficulty scores 数据可获取性（plan_004 硬依赖）\\\\n- [ ] mvp_003 结果（cross-architecture 验证）\\\\n- [ ] Dream 通过后批准 P0 实验\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n**已分配**：westd-13176 4× RTX 6000 PRO 96GB\\\\n**当前使用**：cuda:0 空闲 | cuda:1 空闲(mvp_002完成) | cuda:2 mvp_003 | cuda:3 空闲\\\\n**Critical path**：plan_001(Qwen3-235B INT8 ~235GB) 需 3-4 卡，是全计划瓶颈\\\\n**Fallback**：CaCLR 效果不显著 → paper 退化为 systematic characterization，仍可投但 significance 降级\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-20 | MVP gate: 3/4 PASS，核心假设获充分支持，进入 research 阶段 | mvp_001 |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-20 | P4 criterion 从 ΔAUROC ≥ 2pp 改为 ΔECE ≤ -2pp for ≥3/ | mvp_001 |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-20 | MVP 模型固定为 Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct | — |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-20 | MVP 用 7-8B 模型验证核心假设，不直接上 235B | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1996, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01HdvoCpwWqkAhpqTaQVKp96","session_id":"8b4c3866-7c97-4fea-98c8-a02346ba8153","uuid":"235273c4-d9af-4524-b93b-88fd197ef609","timestamp":"2026-05-20T19:53:06.858Z"}
